msgid "Using Kogito to add prediction capabilities to an application"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use Kogito to add "
"business automation\n"
"to power it up with predictions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Kogito is a next generation business automation toolkit that originates from "
"the well known Open Source project\n"
"Drools (for predictions). Kogito aims at providing another approach\n"
"to business automation where the main message is to expose your business "
"knowledge (processes, rules, decisions, predictions)\n"
"in a domain specific way."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr ""

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr ""

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr ""

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr ""

msgid "A working container runtime (Docker or xref:podman.adoc[Podman])"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image."
"adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a "
"native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this example, we build a very simple microservice which offers one REST "
"endpoint:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/LogisticRegressionIrisData`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This endpoint will be automatically generated based on given PMML file, that "
"in turn will\n"
"make use of generated code to make certain predictions based on the data "
"being processed."
msgstr ""

msgid "PMML file"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The PMML file describes the prediction logic of our microservice.\n"
"It should provide the actual model (Regression, Tree, Scorecard, Clustering, "
"etc.) needed to make the prediction."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prediction endpoints"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Those are the entry points to the service that can be consumed by clients."
msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and "
"create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the complete example."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download "
"an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The solution is located in the `kogito-pmml-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-"
"url}/kogito-pmml-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Creating the Maven Project"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"First, we need a new project. Create a new project with the following "
