msgstr ""

msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` "
"option."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"_For more information about how to install the Quarkus CLI and use it, "
"please refer to xref:cli-tooling.adoc[the Quarkus CLI guide]._"
msgstr ""

msgid "Maven"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool="
"gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This command generates a Maven project, importing the `kogito` extension\n"
"that comes with all needed dependencies and configuration to equip your "
"application\n"
"with business automation.\n"
"It also imports the `resteasy-reactive-jackson` extension that is needed for "
"Kogito to expose REST services."
msgstr ""

