"During project compilation, Kogito will read the file and generate the "
"classes needed for the evaluation, together with a couple of REST endpoints."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To get started quickly copy the PMML file from the\n"
"{quickstarts-tree-url}/kogito-pmml-quickstart/src/main/resources/"
"LogisticRegressionIrisData.pmml[quickstart]."
msgstr ""

